<title>USA: Tappan Zee stake cut by BRT Realty Trust.</title>
<headline>Tappan Zee stake cut by BRT Realty Trust.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRT Realty Trust said Tuesday it reduced its stake in Tappan Zee Financial Inc to 5.33 percent or 82,100 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the company said it sold 63,500 shares of Tappan Zee between August 27 and September 6 at prices ranging from $12.01 to $12.875 a share.</p>
</text>
